{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bdebc64a-2caa-87c2-ae3d-ca19cbd157bd",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T12:08:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:08-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, Lorraine. This is Doug Brownell. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number, the one on the recording. I've lived in my house going on forty years, and I've watched that street through every kind of weather, so I know what I'm talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Brownell. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we had that nor'easter come in Saturday and it wrapped up today, and this morning I went out to look and the water is coming down the hill from the next street over. It runs right down and straight into my yard. Straight in. And the drain at the corner is just full of leaves and gunk, nothing's going down it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what's your address, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:05:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "69 Ruggles Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "69 Ruggles Avenue. And the drain you're talking about, is it right in front of your house or at the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner, just up from my house. Now, I'll tell you, it was not this bad last winter. We had snow, sure, we had melt, and it went down fine. This time it's a pond out there. I'm tired of it, honestly. Every time it rains hard somebody ought to be out there clearing that thing before the storm, not after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. So you're asking that the drain be cleaned out. Is the water in the house at all, or just the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the yard so far. But it's up against the walkway and I don't like where it's headed. I'd like somebody to come and clean that drain. That's what I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got that down. Cleaning request for the storm drain at the corner near 69 Ruggles Avenue, water running down from the next street into your yard. Crews are going to be stretched thin right after a storm like this, but I'll get it into the queue for Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Well. I'd hoped sooner, but I suppose. Listen, I'm not home Monday morning, I usually have errands downtown. I park over by Washington Square when I go in, so if somebody wants to reach me I might not be at the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is the best number to reach you 401-555-0171?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, the landline. If I'm out they can leave a message, the machine works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0171, and they can leave a message. Anything else I should note, like whether anyone could get hurt, a car stuck, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I can see. Just the water in the yard and that drain. I just want it looked at, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:07:56-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in as a request to clean the drain at the corner by 69 Ruggles. If it gets worse tonight and water starts coming toward the house, call this line back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T12:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Brownell. Take care."
    }
  ],
